        <mxCell id="bottomNote" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;KV Cache reuses cached Key/Value states to cut the per-step decoding cost from O(N²) to O(N); it does not remove the O(M²) cost of the initial prompt prefill.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
